\title{nbzinbHossen: NB and ZINB regression by IRLS and EM}
\description{
Negative binomial regression is fitted with \code{\link[=nbreg]{nbreg()}} by iteratively
reweighted least squares alternated with Newton-Raphson for the
dispersion parameter. Zero-inflated negative binomial regression is
fitted with \code{\link[=zinbreg]{zinbreg()}} by an EM algorithm whose M-steps are IRLS fits.
No general-purpose optimizer (such as \code{optim()}) is used.
